From 678b01bf6f2c25516c1615906726c143cc762ecd Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Ian Clarke <sanity@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 3 Mar 2026 21:42:36 -0600
Subject: [PATCH 15/69] fix: add V4 delegate migration entry for Feb 28
 delegate

The Feb 28 deploy rebuilt the delegate WASM via cargo make build,
producing a different binary than the committed chat_delegate.wasm.
The delegate key from that build was not in LEGACY_DELEGATES, causing
users to lose their room data on subsequent deploys.

Added V4 legacy entry extracted from technic node's delegate
registration file (DPzmrQrcs81dttrcuH2ot7PRu3UJfN1fh3H6T7kniwWG.reg).

Also synced ui/public/contracts/chat_delegate.wasm with the current
target build output.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 ui/public/contracts/chat_delegate.wasm | Bin 401592 -> 372195 bytes
 ui/src/components/app/chat_delegate.rs |  12 ++++++++++++
 2 files changed, 12 insertions(+)

diff --git a/ui/public/contracts/chat_delegate.wasm b/ui/public/contracts/chat_delegate.wasm
